Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
